","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"irene-country-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Established in 1998, Irene Country Hotel was built with the vision of providing visitors with an authentic farm experience in a modern elegant urban facility. The owners envisaged a haven of peace and tranquillity in the midst of the city where their love for farming could be shared. What began as a small boutique hotel in the meadows has grown into a countryside experience as additions to the property such as the Camdeboo Day Spa have been done in keeping with the overall farm feel.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":null,"child_max_age":null,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Nellmapius Drive, Irene, Gauteng","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"d13eedf1-9700-40ae-8fce-e9cf1cb277fa","kind":"transfers","name":"Ulysses Tours & Transfers","email":"ulysses@ulysses.co.za","phone":"+27 12 653 0018","website":"https://www.ulysses.co.za/","notes":"Codes:\nATLS - Atlantic Seaboard","active":true,"created_at":"2026-05-18T11:22:16.587292+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"ulysses-tours-transfers","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Ulysses Transfers offers reliable door-to-door airport transfers across South Africa, servicing major airports like OR Tambo, Lanseria, King Shaka, and Cape Town International. They also provide chauffeur services and a variety of tours, including cultural experiences and wildlife safaris in Gauteng, North West Province, and the Western Cape. The fleet includes air-conditioned vehicles with insurance and tracking, and all chauffeurs are qualified, ensuring a safe and comfortable journey for all travelers.","default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":null,"child_max_age":null,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"1 Johannes Dr, Hennopspark, Centurion, 0172","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"d0e609ac-0a8b-4d57-98c6-429986056b3c","kind":"transfers","name":"Wild Horizons - Transfers","email":"debtorscontroller@wildhorizons.co.zw","phone":"+263 78 278 7052","website":"https://wildhorizons.co.za/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T09:42:51.408088+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-19T10:06:38.792273+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"wild-horizons-transfers","location_id":"b53d5ed5-e65a-4b70-be34-cad755be7977","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Wild Horizons is Zimbabwe’s most established and trusted tour operator in Victoria Falls, dedicated to showcasing the many attractions on offer in this extraordinary part of the world. For over 45 years, Wild Horizons has been crafting extraordinary journeys at Victoria Falls with a combined 256 years of guiding experience.","default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"310 Park Way Avenue, Victoria Falls, Zimbabwe","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"c3c2de5c-c68d-41c5-b04a-053708edca5a","kind":"airline","name":"FlySafair","email":"help@flysafair.co.za","phone":"+27 87 357 0030","website":"https://www.flysafair.co.za/","notes":"WhatsApp Support: 087 357 0030 (7:00 AM to 7:00 PM daily)","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-01T09:34:33.028609