49beaa4e","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Victoria Falls Safari Collection","email":"resman@vfsl.co.zw","phone":"+263 83 284 3202","website":"https://victoria-falls-safari-collection.com/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-13T13:51:15.922107+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"victoria-falls-safari-collection","location_id":"b53d5ed5-e65a-4b70-be34-cad755be7977","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"For over 30 years, we’ve been sharing the magic of Victoria Falls with guests from across the globe, proudly becoming Zimbabwe’s leading hospitality family, and offering the finest collection of accommodation offerings, restaurants and experiences in the region. Watch as wildlife gathers at our waterhole, soak up the breathtaking views across the bushveld, and let our full-service spa melt away all your cares. Feel the rhythm and festive energy of the Boma – Dinner & Drum Show. And above all, feel the warmth of our amazing team, dedicated to insure your stay is truly memorable.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"10:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":["Air Conditioning & Ceiling Fan","Tea & coffee making facilities","Extra length beds with mosquito nets","Complimentary Wi-Fi","Customised toiletries including insect repellent and sunscreen"],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Victoria Falls Safari Lodge, Stand 471, Squire Cummings Road, Victoria Falls, Zimbabwe","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":"e5664421-30f5-4cc8-a5ad-c861078fc288","parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"a78f401b-90c9-402d-8d35-0cf3dc79710c","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Portswood Hotel","email":"portswood@legacyhotels.com","phone":"+27 21 418 3281","website":"https://www.legacyhotels.co.za/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:04:42.539893+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"portswood-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"The Portswood Hotel is situated at the entrance of the Victoria & Alfred Waterfront. It features a lobby and restaurant that are built around a 300-year-old well, as well as the cells that once held prisoners bound for Robben Island. Its rich history makes the hotel an intriguing choice for those looking for a unique stay in Cape Town. Additionally, the hotel showcases maritime-themed historical memorabilia, including old maps and menus, offering guests a fascinating glimpse into the past.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"10:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Portswood Square, Portswood Road, V & A Waterfront, Cape Town, 8001","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"a034fb5e-10fc-48bb-be41-9a2c5ec8e681","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Ivory Manor Boutique Hotel","email":"frontoffice@ivorymanor.co.za","phone":"+27 12 110 4380","website":"https://www.ivorymanor.co.za/","notes":"Complimentary shuttle transfers to/from OR Tambo Airport and/or Rovos Rail/Blue Train Stations (Pretoria)","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T07:48:44.844252+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"ivory-manor-boutique-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"This upscale hotel, set in beautiful gardens, is located 30 km from Wonderboom Airport and near Erasmus Castle and Rietvlei Nature Reserve. It features nine elegant rooms with free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs, minibars, and tea and coffee-making facilities. Some rooms include balconies or chandeliers. Breakfast is included, and amenities include a wine cellar, an elegant restaurant with a terrace, an outdoor pool, and meeting spaces. An airport shuttle service is also available.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"10:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":3,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":["24-hour front desk","Wheelchair access","Bar / Lounge","Business Centre","Secured parking","Conference facilities","Free parking","Laundry service","Outdoor Pool","Restaurant","Room service","BBQ / Picnic area","WIFI"],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"280 Jochem St, Rietvalleirand, Pretoria, 0122","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"9745a6fe-aa3a-44e5-bea1-dd0e759b9712","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Victoria & Alfred Hotel","email":"sales@newmarkhotels.com","phone":"+27 021 419 6677","website":"https://newmarkhotels.com/","notes":"Loft Rooms: Cannot accommodate a cot or extra bed.\nChildren (2–11 years): Extra bed rates apply. One extra bed per room, available on request in Mountain and Piazza Facing Rooms (subject to availability).","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T08:13:07.482161+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"victoria-alfred-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"A 1904 North Quay Warehouse turned luxury hotel. History and modern luxury merge to create ageless beauty at the Victoria & Alfred Hotel. This iconic establishment was named after Queen Victoria and her son, Prince Alfred, who played an intrinsic role in the establishment of the Breakwater Basin, now the V&A Waterfront. The hotel is located in this acclaimed destination and is a sophisticated retreat amid the buzz. It offers some of the most enviable views of the Harbour, Table Mountain and the slick city that stretches out at the foot of this Natural Wonder.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":1,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":["Complimentary beverage on arrival","Complimentary Wi-Fi","Housekeeping offered twice daily","Room service available 24/7","Secure parking"],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"PierHead, V&A Complex, Dock Rd, Victoria & Alfred Waterfront, Cape Town","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"87cbbf54-5085-4146-afe7-172f522b3325","kind":"tour_operator","name":"City Sightseeing Bus Tours","email":"info@citysightseeing.co.za","phone":"+27 21 511 6000","website":"https://citysightseeing.co.za/","notes":"Agents Login: https://agent.citysightseeing.co.za/en/login/agent \n\nCancellation Fees R20 admin fee per voucher, at the discretion of City Sightseeing Management.\nChildren 0 - 3 Free of Charge. Child fares apply to children from 4 up to 17 years of age.","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-01T08:26:00.843085+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-18T12:59:45.68352+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"city-sightseeing-bus-tours","location_id":null,"single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Starts: At any of the 20 Hop-on-Hop-off Stops Tour assistance office - V&A Waterfront, located outside the Two Oceans Aquarium - CBD, located at 81 Long Street Duration: Valid from the first day of use. * Classic Ticket: 1 day * Premium Ticket: 2 consecutive days * Deluxe Ticket: 3 consecutive days Operates: Hop-on-Hop- off tours and boat cruises operate daily.   Know before you go: Hop-on-Hop-off at any of the stops along the route network and simply show the same ticket when boarding. Your ticket remains valid for the duration of the ticket purchased (1, 2 or 3 consecutive days). Cancellation Policy: Refundable if not used within the validity period. Cancellation fee of R20, per ticket cancelled, will be charged and a refund request must be sent before the voucher expires. Entrances are not included What's included in each ticket All tickets include unlimited Hop-on-Hop-off bus access on the Red, Blue and Purple routes. Premium and Deluxe Tickets include additional experiences. Please refer to the ticket comparison section above for full details.","default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":3,"child_max_age":17,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"36 Auckland Street, Paarden Eiland, Cape Town, 7420","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"7dafbd36-5230-4a89-b587-4c37d409edaf","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Kruger Shalati - Train on the Bridge","email":"info@krugershalati.com","phone":"+27 13 591 6000","website":"https://www.krugershalati.com/","notes":"Children staying at Kruger Shalati Train on the Bridge:\n* Children below the age of 12 will not be allowed to stay in the Train on the Bridge. They will need to be accommodated in Kruger Shalati Bridge House.\n\nOur rate includes the following: Accommodation, all meals, teas and coffees, daily soft drinks, house wines, local brand spirits and beers. It also includes two game drives daily in open game drive vehicles. There is also a complementary return road transfers between the Skukuza Airport and the lodge.\n\nOur rate excludes the following: 1% compulsory community levy and Kruger National Park Entrance fees, premium beverages, telephone calls, and purchases from the Kruger Shalati Curio Shop. The rate also excludes spa treatments (outsourced) and transfers to and from the lodge other than to/from Skukuza Airport, and where applicable gratuities.","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:13:48.602562+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"kruger-shalati-train-on-the-bridge","location_id":"3ac373b2-7038-4838-aeae-df286c2653f3","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Experience the breathtaking beauty of Africa combined with luxurious comfort aboard a newly refurbished train that embodies African excellence. Permanently stationed on the historically rich Selati Bridge above the Sabie River, Kruger Shalati offers unique luxury accommodation in a reimagined train. This train pays tribute to the guests who explored the park nearly 100 years ago while inviting new adventurers from near and far. It marks the spot where the first visits to the iconic Kruger National Park were allowed in the early 1920s, when the train would overnight exactly where Kruger Shalati is now located.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":5,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Selati Station & Bridge, Skukuza Rest Camp, Kruger National Park","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"6c0e0491-c9d7-4b97-b89d-428a57ff166d","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Grootbos","email":"info@grootbos.co.za","phone":"+27 28 384 8053","website":"https://www.grootbos.com/","notes":"Garden Lodge - Adults & children - One bedroom luxury suite\nChildren under 4 yrs - free\n4-10 yrs (max 2 on sleeper couch in lounge)\n11-16 yrs (max 1 on sleeper couch in lounge)\nChildren of all ages staying in their own bedroom, pay full adult rate\nGarden Lodge - Adults & children - Two bedroom family suite\nRate per suite for 2 adults and up to 3 children\nForest Lodge - Adults & children (12-16 yrs) only - One bedroom luxury suite\nMax 2 children on sleeper couch in lounge\nSuperbloom season special - SADC rates - 01 May - 30 Sept","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T13:21:46.803899+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"grootbos","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Grootbos Private Nature Reserve is a luxurious conservation estate near Gansbaai in the Western Cape. Set within the Cape Floral Kingdom, it is renowned for its spectacular fynbos, ancient Milkwood forests and exceptional biodiversity. Guests can enjoy guided nature walks, botanical safaris, whale watching and other immersive experiences. Grootbos offers luxurious, spacious suites designed to blend into the surrounding fynbos and Milkwood forests. The accommodation is intimate and private, with beautiful views, comfortable living areas, elegant bathrooms and private outdoor spaces.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":10,"child_max_age":16,"inclusions":["Welcome drink served on arrival","Complimentary Wi-Fi","Water, soft drinks, tea and coffee, minibar","Breakfast buffet with a la carte Breakfast menu","Light Lunch","A la carte Dinner","Horse riding","Fynbos hike on the reserve","4x4 Flower Safari","Coastal drive with seasonal land-based whale watching","Beach picnics","Ancient Klipgate Cave and Walker Bay Nature Reserve beach excursion","Bird watching","Transfers to/from all activities"],"exclusions":["Alcoholic beverages","Laundry","Spa treatments","Items of personal nature","Grootbos Conservation Contribution - R400.00 pppn"],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"R43, Gansbaai, 7220","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"683e71eb-eb88-4c85-8b0a-4b1edb1c138d","kind":"hotel_property","name":"TAJ Hotel","email":"shanaaz.rhoda@tajhotels.com","phone":"+27218192000","website":"https://www.tajhotels.com/","notes":"CHILD POLICY:\n0-2 can be accommodated in Luxury City/Mountain view rooms (free cot)\n3+ One Bedroom Suite at R400 per night (incl. breakfast)\n\nCHECK-IN/OUT:\nCheck-in at 15h00\nCheck-out at 12h00","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-01T07:26:47.837801+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"taj-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"This elegant hotel comprises a modern tower, a 19th-century office block, and a 1932 bank building. The stylish rooms feature minibars, complimentary Wi-Fi, iPod docks, and smart TVs. Some rooms boast high ceilings or private balconies. Suites include additional lounges and butler service, while a two-floor penthouse suite offers stunning views of Table Mountain, along with a gym and a steam room.  Room service is also available. Dining options at the hotel include three restaurants and a lobby lounge. Additionally, there is an Ayurvedic spa, a fitness centre; and an indoor pool.","default_time_start":"15:00:00","default_time_end":"12:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"1 Wale Street corner Saint Georges Mall, Wale St, Cape Town City Centre, Cape Town, 8000","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"64259109-3815-4df1-b88e-2ea48801deb2","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Radisson Collection","email":"reservations.capetown@radissoncollection.com","phone":"+27 021 441 3000","website":"https://www.radissonhotels.com/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-18T06:57:11.267777+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-18T07:33:07.326991+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"radisson-collection","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Wake to the sound of waves breaking on the shore from the Radisson Collection Hotel, Waterfront. We are uniquely situated on the water’s edge close to the city center and iconic attractions such as Table Mountain, Robben Island, and the Victoria & Alfred Waterfront. Indulge in memorable cuisine at Tobago’s Restaurant, Bar & Terrace or unwind with a cocktail at our infinity pool, both offering incredible ocean vistas. Feel your tension melt away at our Amani Spa & Wellness, offering unforgettable experiences that will leave you feeling refreshed, rejuvenated, and renewed.","default_time_start":"15:00:00","default_time_end":"12:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":0,"child_max_age":0,"inclusions":["Complimentary Wi-Fi","Coffee & tea facilities"],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"100 Beach Road, Granger Bay Blvd, Mouille Point, Cape Town, 8002","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"53278302-6b75-4a49-9f16-cd8cf6d4fef6","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Raphael Penthouse Suites","email":"raphael@legacyhotels.com","phone":"+27 11 245 6000","website":"https://www.legacyhotels.co.za/","notes":"Children\nChildren aged 12 years and younger (maximum two children per room) will be accommodated free of charge on a Bed Only basis if sharing with one or two adults, but will be charged for breakfast. Children occupying their own rooms will be charged the full adult rate. Children aged 0-2, no charge. Children aged 3-12, 50% of the applicable rate per meal per day for breakfast. This policy does not apply to room service meals.\n\nSatellite TV\nBathroom with bath\nBathrobes\nSlippers\nTea and coffee making set\nLeisure section of the room\nSmart Tv\nSafe\nStove\nBathroom with shower\nFridge\nToaster\nMicrowave\nIron and ironing board\nOven\nCookware\nTowels\nAir Conditioning\nHairdryer\nInternet available\nDesk\nWardrobe\nOne bedroom\nFree WiFi\nFree Parking\nPrivate bathroom\nLounge\nDining area\nOutdoor dining area\nKitchen fully equipped\nFlat screen TV\nLimited DSTV bouquet\nElectronic safe\nComplimentary tea & coffee\nIndividually controlled air-conditioner\nDirect-dialing telephones","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T08:26:12.770819+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"raphael-penthouse-suites","location_id":"6ddeee99-110e-4a91-bdaf-14cc9159abc6","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Raphael Penthouse Suites offers exclusive all-suite accommodations for both long-term and short-term stays, catering to discerning guests who want to experience the vibrant energy of city living. Situated overlooking Nelson Mandela Square, guests can enjoy a variety of restaurants and lifestyle options nearby, along with easy access to the adjacent Sandton City Mall, Legacy Corner Mall, and Michelangelo Towers Mall. Raphael Penthouse Suites provides an unparalleled lifestyle for a fortunate few, making luxury more convenient than ever.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"10:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"163 5th Street, Sandown, Sandton, 2031","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"4ec1e87e-a7f5-401a-9b04-0807b1f34f9c","kind":"hotel_property","name":"The Commodore Hotel","email":"commodore@legacyhotels.com","phone":"+27 21 415 1000","website":"https://www.legacyhotels.co.za/","notes":"Satellite TV\nMinibar\nTea and coffee making set\nSmart Tv\nSafe\nBathroom with shower\nTowels\nAir Conditioning\nHairdryer\nInternet available\nTV\nDesk\nWardrobe\n\nSatellite TV\nMinibar\nTea and coffee making set\nSmart Tv\nSafe\nBathroom with shower\nTowels\nAir Conditioning\nHairdryer\nInternet available\nTV\nDesk\nWardrobe","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T08:47:30.900114+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"the-commodore-hotel","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"This harbour-view hotel is a 4-minute walk from the V&A Waterfront and within walking distance of the Two Oceans Aquarium and the Cape Town Diamond Museum. The contemporary rooms feature minibars, free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs, and tea/coffee-making facilities, with 24-hour room service available. On-site amenities include a cocktail bar, a restaurant with a harbour-view terrace, a spa, a 24-hour gym, a business centre, and two meeting rooms.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"10:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Portswood Rd, Victoria & Alfred Waterfront, Cape Town, 8002","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"32a37b5e-6880-4ead-bf7c-3d416cbd10bd","kind":"tour_operator","name":"Robben Island","email":"infow@robben-island.org.za","phone":"+27 21 413 4200","website":"https://www.robben-island.org.za/","notes":"Peak season 01 Sept - 30 Apr | 4 tours per day at 09h00, 11h00, 13h00 & 15h00\n01 May - 31 Aug | 3 tours per day at 09h00, 11h00 & 13h00\nThe ferries depart from the Nelson Mandela Gateway at the V & A Waterfront. The tour takes 3.5 hours including the ferry trip to and from the Island (Depending on the boat used as they have different travel times).","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-19T13:25:21.825427+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-20T08:45:59.566638+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"robben-island-museum-tour","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":null,"default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":null,"child_max_age":17,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"V&A Waterfront, Cape Town, 8002","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":"e5664421-30f5-4cc8-a5ad-c861078fc288","parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"287e3a06-46fc-4676-a5c2-5faaa576bfe7","kind":"hotel_property","name":"DaVinci Hotel & Suites","email":"davinci@legacyhotels.com","phone":"+27 11 292 7000","website":"https://www.legacyhotels.co.za/","notes":"Children\nChildren aged 12 years and younger (maximum one child per room) will be accommodated free of charge on a Bed Only basis if sharing with one or two adults, but will be charged for breakfast. Children occupying their own rooms will be charged the full adult rate. Children aged 0-2, no charge. Children aged 3-12, 50% of the applicable rate per meal per day for breakfast. This policy does not apply to room service meals.\n\nSatellite TV\nBathroom with bath\nMinibar\nSlippers\nTea and coffee making set\nSafe\nBathroom with shower\nTowels\nAir Conditioning\nHairdryer\nInternet available\nTV\nDesk\nWardrobe\n40 inch LCD flat-screen TV\n51 DSTV channels and 9 Radio stations\nLegacy channel\nOpen minibar stocked on request\nNespresso machine\nEn suite bathroom","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-07T08:06:40.732287+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"davinci-hotel-suites","location_id":"6ddeee99-110e-4a91-bdaf-14cc9159abc6","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"This luxurious hotel is located in Sandton's financial district, connected to Legacy Corner Mall and near the Sandton Convention Centre and Sandton City Mall, just 2.9 km from the M1 motorway. The contemporary rooms feature elegant furnishings, free Wi-Fi, and satellite TV. Suites include full kitchens, with 24/7 room service available. Guests can relax at the infinity pool with a sundeck, enjoy the full-service spa and gym, and dine at a fine restaurant specializing in Asian fusion cuisine. An ornate lounge offers a selection of wine, whiskey, and cigars. The hotel also provides conference space for up to 120 guests.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Corner 5th Street &, Maude St, Sandton, 2031","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"21518d1e-d3c1-4092-8108-2a35f6cca629","kind":"hotel_property","name":"12 Apostles Hotel & Spa","email":"hotelmanager@12apostles.co.za","phone":"+27 021 437 9000","website":"https://www.12apostleshotel.com/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T11:10:57.885629+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"12-apostles-hotel-spa","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001002","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"The Twelve Apostles Hotel and Spa is a coastal sanctuary poised above the Atlantic Ocean in the shadow of South Africa's most famous Table Mountain range. This 5-star boutique hotel is the perfect place to watch the sun set into the Atlantic, dine on fine international cuisine, luxuriate in the award-winning Spa, or simply relax and enjoy warm, first-class service. Boasting 70 elegant, individually-designed rooms and suites, in-house guests are spoilt by incomparable ocean or mountain vistas from almost every room, each of which is a sophisticated haven of luxury and comfort.","default_time_start":"14:00:00","default_time_end":"11:00:00","location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":["Welcome drink on arrival","Full English breakfast incl. freshly harvested oysters and sparkling wine","Complimentary internet access","Complimentary access to the Hydrotherapy pools, heated and cold plunge pools at the Spa","Complimentary newspaper daily","Complimentary scheduled transfer service to and from Camps Bay and the V&A Waterfront, between 08h00 and 21h30"],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"Victoria Road, Camps Bay, Cape Town, 8005","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"12c57dfd-a4fb-45eb-8d36-32d615601515","kind":"airline","name":"Fly SAA","email":"webhelp@flysaa.com","phone":"+27 11 978 1111","website":"https://www.flysaa.com/","notes":"Office Hours : Daily, 06h00am to 01h00am (SAST)\n\nOpen weekends and on public holidays","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-17T09:21:00.753772+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"saa","location_id":null,"single_supplement_pct":0,"description":null,"default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":1,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"manual","street_address":null,"emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"100f03b0-fefd-4d50-85e7-64a715914c47","kind":"hotel_property","name":"Apogee Boutique Hotel and Spa","email":"reservations@apogeehotel.co.za","phone":"+27 12 786 0740","website":"https://www.apogeehotel.co.za/","notes":"Important information\nEarly check in fees: (Subject to availability) •Full night's rate chargeable for an early check in from 8 am (this is guaranteed as the room is booked from the night before your arrival) • R850 chargeable for an early check in from 11am Late check out fees: (Subject to availability not guaranteed) •R850 chargeable for a late check out at 12pm • R1350 chargeable for a late check out at 14pm • Full night's rate chargeable for a late check out after 14pm\nAnimals\nPets are not accepted.\nParking\nCar park is free of charge to all hotel guests - space reservation is not required.\nCancellation policy\n1. Cancellation within 21 days of date of arrival is 50% payable of full accommodation balance.\n2. Cancellation within 14 days of date of arrival is 100% payable of full accommodation\nbalance.\nChildren policy\n1. Children under the age of 12 years are charged at R750 bed & breakfast in any room type\nexcept for the standard suite.\n2. Extra bed policy: Children over the age of 12 years are charged at R1300 bed & breakfast in\nany other room type except for the standard suite.","active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-01T08:07:23.544688+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"apogee-boutique-hotel-and-spa","location_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001","single_supplement_pct":0,"description":"Located in Waterkloof Ridge, this upscale all-suite hotel is 4 km from Brooklyn Mall and 7 km from Groenkloof Nature Reserve. Elegant suites feature original artwork, Wi-Fi, smart TVs, minibars, and in-room exercise equipment. Some suites offer balconies and separate living rooms with butler service. Hotel amenities include a refined restaurant, upscale spa, outdoor pool, and complimentary breakfast and parking.","default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":null,"child_max_age":12,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":"212 Johann Rissik Dr, Waterkloof Ridge, Pretoria, 0181","emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"d0ddb7fc-2f8a-4214-8f20-cc73ad15f4ae","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"0a0c8cf1-025f-4c75-911e-d1299f2288a7","kind":"airline","name":"Lift","email":"support@lift.co.za.","phone":null,"website":null,"notes":"WhatsApp us on +2776 650 0972.\n7am to 7pm and weekends from 8am to 5pm","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-17T08:56:39.353401+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"lift","location_id":null,"single_supplement_pct":0,"description":null,"default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":1,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"manual","street_address":null,"emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"046d8697-e968-449f-8c36-aebfdef1a53e","kind":"airline","name":"Cemair","email":"tickets@cemair.co.za","phone":"+27 11 021 0270","website":"https://www.cemair.co.za/","notes":"Monday-Friday: 06h00 – 19h00\nSaturday, Sunday & Public Holidays: 08h00 – 17h00","active":true,"created_at":"2026-08-17T09:03:41.276695+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:49:40.412719+00:00","status":"active","location":null,"slug":"cemair","location_id":null,"single_supplement_pct":0,"description":null,"default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":2,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":[],"exclusions":[],"pricing_mode":"manual","street_address":null,"emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":null,"parent_supplier_id":null},{"id":"002b438f-df83-483a-9274-f17e9fef7f35","kind":"train_operator","name":"Blue Train","email":"joseph.sono@transnet.net","phone":"+27 12 315 8242","website":"https://www.bluetrain.co.za/","notes":null,"active":true,"created_at":"2026-05-18T09:38:43.241232+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T20:09:08.894048+00:00","status":"active","location":"Pretoria","slug":"the-blue-train","location_id":null,"single_supplement_pct":50,"description":"The Blue Train offers an iconic luxury rail experience through the heart of South Africa, renowned for its elegance and world-class service. This prestigious train operates routes primarily between Pretoria and Cape Town, a 54-hour journey covering 1600 kilometers (994 miles) through diverse and spectacular scenery.\nGuests aboard The Blue Train can expect opulent accommodations, including Deluxe and Luxury Suites, all en-suite with marble and gold-plated fittings. Onboard amenities feature fine dining, a lounge car, and a club car, providing an atmosphere of refined comfort. The journey includes an off-train excursion with a visit to the Kimberley Diamond Mine Museum, enhancing the immersive travel experience. The Blue Train has consistently been recognized as Africa's Leading Luxury Train, offering a unique blend of heritage and modern luxury.","default_time_start":null,"default_time_end":null,"location_area_id":null,"infant_max_age":5,"child_max_age":11,"inclusions":["All applicable snacks, meals & drinks (alcoholic & non-alcoholic), Cognacs, and Cuban cigars","High Tea","Blue Train Gift & Certificate","Butler service","Wi-Fi (signal dependent)","Off the train excursion (weather & time permitted)"],"exclusions":["French Champagne, caviar, telephone calls, and gratuities whilst on board The Blue Train.","Services not mentioned."],"pricing_mode":"rate_card","street_address":null,"emergency_phone":null,"default_contact_name":null,"base_rate_type_id":"78fc2fd2-ea30-4698-8bcd-df86c90c3f80","quote_rate_type_id":"02879291-1b92-4d0b-996d-613423d4c746","parent_supplier_id":null}]$seedjson$::json)
